OL,3,GNEWSARed Arrows fly again after Hawk
OL,4,Apause
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Red Arrows have resumed flying as
OL,7,Fpart of a display in Lincolnshire after
OL,8,Fthey were grounded earlier in the week.
OL,10,FThe RAF paused Hawk fighter jet
OL,11,Ftraining as a precautionary measure
OL,12,Ffollowing a crash involving a T2 jet in
OL,13,FWales on Wednesday.
OL,15,FTwo pilots flying a training aircraft
OL,16,Fwere treated for minor injuries after
OL,17,Fthey ejected from their plane before it
OL,18,Fcrashed in Anglesey.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
